		</div>
		<div class="study-image-caption">The Player Aid. Two sides, every piece with stats, turn phases anchored at the bottom. Started as a Turn Phases card on its own.</div>
	</div>

	<!-- KOB Move Tracker -->
	<div class="study-image-block narrow">
		<div class="study-image">
			<img src="/images/case-studies/quickfuze/kob-move-tracker.jpg" alt="King of Battle Move Tracker, a small companion card for keeping turn state visible" />
